            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que sinal usamos para verificar se dois valores são iguais?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use um sinal para verificar se dois valores são iguais. Qual linha verifica se <code>score</code> tem o valor <code>10</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score == 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>score = 10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>score != 10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>score == 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
